{"ayah/66-1.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir At-Tahrim 66:1 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Wahai Nabi! Mengapa engkau mengharamkan apa yang dihalalkan Allah bagimu? Engkau ingin menyenangkan hati istri-istrimu? Dan Allah Maha Pengampun, Maha Peny\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/66-1.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir At-Tahrim 66:1 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Wahai Nabi! Mengapa engkau mengharamkan apa yang dihalalkan Allah bagimu? Engkau ingin menyenangkan hati istri-istrimu? Dan Allah Maha Pengampun, Maha Peny\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah At-Tahrim\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/66.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 1\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/66-1.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/66.html\">Surah At-Tahrim</a> › Ayat 1</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah At-Tahrim 66:1</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ يَا أَيُّهَا النَّبِيُّ لِمَ تُحَرِّمُ مَا أَحَلَّ اللَّهُ لَكَ تَبْتَغِي مَرْضَاتَ أَزْوَاجِكَ وَاللَّهُ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Wahai Nabi! Mengapa engkau mengharamkan apa yang dihalalkan Allah bagimu? Engkau ingin menyenangkan hati istri-istrimu? Dan Allah Maha Pengampun, Maha Penyayang.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ونوع يكون الخطاب له وللأمة فأفرده بالخطاب لكونه هو المواجه بالوحي وهو الأصل فيه والمبلغ للأمة والسفير بينهم وبين الله<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/167</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s66a1\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/id/ayah/66-2.html\">Ayat berikutnya (66:2)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/66-2.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir At-Tahrim 66:2 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Sungguh, Allah telah mewajibkan kepadamu membebaskan diri dari sumpahmu; dan Allah adalah pelindungmu dan Dia Maha Mengetahui, Mahabijaksana.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/66-2.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir At-Tahrim 66:2 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sungguh, Allah telah mewajibkan kepadamu membebaskan diri dari sumpahmu; dan Allah adalah pelindungmu dan Dia Maha Mengetahui, Mahabijaksana.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah At-Tahrim\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/66.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 2\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/66-2.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/66.html\">Surah At-Tahrim</a> › Ayat 2</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah At-Tahrim 66:2</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿قَدْ فَرَضَ اللَّهُ لَكُمْ تَحِلَّةَ أَيْمَانِكُمْ وَاللَّهُ مَوْلَاكُمْ وَهُوَ الْعَلِيمُ الْحَكِيمُ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Sungguh, Allah telah mewajibkan kepadamu membebaskan diri dari sumpahmu; dan Allah adalah pelindungmu dan Dia Maha Mengetahui, Mahabijaksana.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالخطاب له خطاب لجميع الجنس<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 14/274</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وهذا يتناول جميع أيمان المسلمين لفظا ومعنى. أما اللفظ فلقوله: {قد فرض الله لكم تحلة أيمانكم} وقوله: {ذلك كفارة أيمانكم} وهذا خطاب للمؤمنين فكل ما كان من أيمانهم فهو داخل في هذا<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 33/50</cite></blockquote><h3>Yang beliau nukil dari selainnya</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم</span> <span class=\"st\">استشهد به</span> «{من حلف على يمين فرأى غيرها خيرا منها فليأت الذي هو خير وليكفر عن يمينه}»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 33/50</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ودخل في قوله: {قد فرض الله لكم تحلة أيمانكم} [التحريم: 2] كل يمين منعقدة<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 1/251</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s66a2\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/66-1.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (66:1)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/66-5.html\">Ayat berikutnya (66:5)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/66-5.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir At-Tahrim 66:5 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Jika dia (Nabi) menceraikan kamu, boleh jadi Tuhan akan memberi ganti kepadanya dengan istri-istri yang lebih baik dari kamu, perempuan-perempuan yang patu\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/66-5.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir At-Tahrim 66:5 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Jika dia (Nabi) menceraikan kamu, boleh jadi Tuhan akan memberi ganti kepadanya dengan istri-istri yang lebih baik dari kamu, perempuan-perempuan yang patu\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah At-Tahrim\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/66.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 5\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/66-5.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/66.html\">Surah At-Tahrim</a> › Ayat 5</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah At-Tahrim 66:5</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿عَسَىٰ رَبُّهُ إِن طَلَّقَكُنَّ أَن يُبْدِلَهُ أَزْوَاجًا خَيْرًا مِّنكُنَّ مُسْلِمَاتٍ مُّؤْمِنَاتٍ قَانِتَاتٍ تَائِبَاتٍ عَابِدَاتٍ سَائِحَاتٍ ثَيِّبَاتٍ وَأَبْكَارًا﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Jika dia (Nabi) menceraikan kamu, boleh jadi Tuhan akan memberi ganti kepadanya dengan istri-istri yang lebih baik dari kamu, perempuan-perempuan yang patuh, yang beriman, yang taat, yang bertobat, yang beribadah, yang berpuasa, yang janda dan yang perawan.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ودخول الواو ههنا متعين لأن الأوصاف التي قبلها المراد اجتماعها في النساء<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/54</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وأما وصفا البكارة والثيوبة فلا يمكن اجتماعهما فتعين العطف لأن المقصود أنه يزوجه بالنوعين الثيبات والأبكار.<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/54</cite></blockquote><h3>Yang beliau nukil dari selainnya</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">القائلون بواو الثمانية</span> <span class=\"st\">ردّه</span> «فقيل هذه واو الثمانية لمجيئها بعد الوصف السابع»<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/54</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">عمر</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «واجتمع على رسول الله - صلى الله عليه وسلم - نساؤه في الغيرة، فقال لهن عمر: {عسى ربه إن طلقكن أن يبدله أزواجا خيرا منكن} [التحريم: 5] فنزلت كذلك.»<cite>«الطرق الحكمية» 1/28</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s66a5\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/66-2.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (66:2)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/66-8.html\">Ayat berikutnya (66:8)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/66-8.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir At-Tahrim 66:8 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Wahai orang-orang yang beriman! Bertobatlah kepada Allah dengan tobat yang semurni-murninya, mudah-mudahan Tuhan kamu akan menghapus kesalahan-kesalahanmu \">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/66-8.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir At-Tahrim 66:8 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Wahai orang-orang yang beriman! Bertobatlah kepada Allah dengan tobat yang semurni-murninya, mudah-mudahan Tuhan kamu akan menghapus kesalahan-kesalahanmu \">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah At-Tahrim\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/66.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 8\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/66-8.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/66.html\">Surah At-Tahrim</a> › Ayat 8</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah At-Tahrim 66:8</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿يَا أَيُّهَا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا تُوبُوا إِلَى اللَّهِ تَوْبَةً نَّصُوحًا عَسَىٰ رَبُّكُمْ أَن يُكَفِّرَ عَنكُمْ سَيِّئَاتِكُمْ وَيُدْخِلَكُمْ جَنَّاتٍ تَجْرِي مِن تَحْتِهَا الْأَنْهَارُ يَوْمَ لَا يُخْزِي اللَّهُ النَّبِيَّ وَالَّذِينَ آمَنُوا مَعَهُ نُورُهُمْ يَسْعَىٰ بَيْنَ أَيْدِيهِمْ وَبِأَيْمَانِهِمْ يَقُولُونَ رَبَّنَا أَتْمِمْ لَنَا نُورَنَا وَاغْفِرْ لَنَا إِنَّكَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيرٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Wahai orang-orang yang beriman! Bertobatlah kepada Allah dengan tobat yang semurni-murninya, mudah-mudahan Tuhan kamu akan menghapus kesalahan-kesalahanmu dan memasukkan kamu ke dalam surga-surga yang mengalir di bawahnya sungai-sungai, pada hari ketika Allah tidak mengecewakan Nabi dan orang-orang yang beriman bersama dengannya; sedang cahaya mereka memancar di hadapan dan di sebelah kanan mereka, sambil mereka berkata, &quot;Ya Tuhan kami, sempurnakanlah untuk kami cahaya kami dan ampunilah kami; sungguh, Engkau Mahakuasa atas segala sesuatu.&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">و &quot; نصوح &quot; هي صفة للتوبة وهي مشتقة من النصح والنصيحة. وأصل ذلك هو الخلوص.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/57</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فمن خرج من قلبه الشبهة والشهوة لم يعد إلى الذنب فهذه التوبة النصوح وهي واجبة بما أمر الله تعالى؛<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/58</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولو تاب العبد ثم عاد إلى الذنب قبل الله توبته الأولى ثم إذا عاد استحق العقوبة فإن تاب تاب الله عليه أيضا.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/58</cite></blockquote><h3>Yang beliau nukil dari selainnya</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">عمر بن الخطاب وغيره من الصحابة والتابعين</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «التوبة النصوح: أن يتوب من الذنب ثم لا يعود إليه»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/57</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s66a8\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/66-5.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (66:5)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/66-11.html\">Ayat berikutnya (66:11)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/66-11.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<m